# GAME SPECS
	

# GAME BEHAVIOR
	- Map is hidden to everyone EXCEPT those who have found a "map" item
	- ONLY neighbouring rooms are visible to you without a map
	- Popup messages for clues
	- Map reveals a certain area around you, NOT THE ENTIRE MAP (because we are lazy)

	- Items can have rarities

# FOR DEVELOPERS
	- Game map is a grid of "rooms" with attributes (room, corridor etc)
	- Check ncurses library (for alex)
